{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inkoid isn\u2019t just another shooter fought on the ground. Here, you fly freely through the sky and paint designated structures in your team\u2019s color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there are rival players\u2014and bosses who hate to see anything painted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Free-Flight Aerial Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the ground! Fly freely and use the battlefield in full 3D. Secure the high ground for an advantage, and turn the tide by raining ink from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Strategic Structure Capture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal isn\u2019t kills\u2014it\u2019s control. Paint structures across the map in your team\u2019s color to claim them and build your path to victory. Cover everything with your color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Team-Based 3v3 Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t win alone. Soar through the sky with your teammates, communicate, coordinate, and fight together. Only perfect teamwork will make you the winners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 7 Unique Weapon Types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a weapon that fits your style and dominate the battlefield:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter: Versatile rifle for all-around combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotgun: Devastating at close range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper: Precision long-range firepower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homing Missiles: Smart missiles that chase down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG: Rocket launcher with explosive area damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill: Brutal melee weapon that tears through anything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatling: A heavy machine gun for suppressive fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 8 Game-Changing Power Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use randomly appearing power-ups to turn the tide of battle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Buff Items (for yourself):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited ink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invincibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Debuff Items (against enemies):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscure enemy vision</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrink enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halve enemy ink capacity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse enemy controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/92756f35e764fa53e0aa3f8a3e717652.avif?t=1773061926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/92756f35e764fa53e0aa3f8a3e717652.webp?t=1773061926 width=1560 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 5 Distinct Arenas</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stadium</strong>: Mess up the stadium with ink.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night City</strong>: Paint tall vertical buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pipe World</strong>: Paint the insides of pipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planets</strong>: Paint entire planets to your heart\u2019s content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/35a52679c2612185d2f3d4332f9b31c4.avif?t=1773061926\" width=1539 height=631 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/adc574a9e43b34cb78ab616642e29110.avif?t=1773061926\" width=1541 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/f76ed846be924d0c882a49ce92d84076.avif?t=1773061926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/f76ed846be924d0c882a49ce92d84076.avif?t=1773061926 width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/dc1704c3035770fa74ab7c9b2a4abd33.avif?t=1773061926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/dc1704c3035770fa74ab7c9b2a4abd33.avif?t=1773061926 width=1560 height=782 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Bosses That Interrupt Your Painting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features bosses that interfere with your painting\u2014they\u2019re here to stop uninvited mess-makers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/7b2f9adbe6207d06d1a0fc9fbad8f519.avif?t=1773061926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/7b2f9adbe6207d06d1a0fc9fbad8f519.avif?t=1773061926 width=1560 height=810 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_